 alla sua porta.","tagline":"Chi trae vantaggio dal reato?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Crime is Mine","overview":"In 1930s Paris, Madeleine, a pretty, young, penniless, and talentless actress, is accused of murdering a famous producer. Helped by her best friend, Pauline, a young, unemployed lawyer, she is acquitted on the grounds of self-defense. A new life of fame and success begins, until the truth comes out.","tagline":"Who benefits from the crime?"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Dans les années 30 à Paris, Madeleine Verdier, jeune et jolie actrice sans le sou et sans talent, est accusée du meurtre d’un célèbre producteur. Aidée de sa meilleure amie Pauline, jeune avocate au chômage, elle est acquittée pour légitime défense. Commence alors une nouvelle vie, faite de gloire et de succès, jusqu’à ce que la vérité éclate au grand jour.","tagline":"À qui profite le crime ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/afW8rBavbDLOWPXLZOv1cUknZKK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/czVIuIXqDPgCBHI3vLYQcRtzAo7.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":977506,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/afW8rBavbDLOWPXLZOv1cUknZKK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/afW8rBavbDLOWPXLZOv1cUknZKK.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/afW8rBavbDLOWPXLZOv1cUknZKK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/afW8rBavbDLOWPXLZOv1cUknZKK.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/48Bh9NGXLfKIoHQ3xSRQayt1b7d.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/48Bh9NGXLfKIoHQ3xSRQayt1b7d.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"available","s